---
title: Draft posts
layout: layouts/home.njk
permalink: /drafts/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
draft: true
---

<h1>Draft posts</h1>
<p>These are draft posts visible only during local development. They are hidden from production builds until `draft: false` is set.</p>

{% set drafts = collections.draftPosts | sort(attribute="date", reverse=true) %}

{% if drafts.length %}
  <ol class="postlist">
  {% for post in drafts %}
    <li>
      <article>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="post-meta">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.tags %} • {{ post.data.tags | join(", ") }}{% endif %}</p>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </article>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ol>
{% else %}
  <p>No draft posts found yet. Create one with <code>npm run new-post -- "My Post Title"</code>.</p>
{% endif %}
